{"title":"Sapling Treant","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 20 Treant that attacks with crush (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">slash</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 15% damage (the game's own rule). Monsters have no resistances.</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 3 times (1.4% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 5× XP and 5× loot.</p>\n      <p class=\"s\">Special: regrowthFracPerSec: .0075</p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/sapling-treant\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/sapling-treant?lv=17\">Lv 17 <span>25</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/sapling-treant?lv=18\">Lv 18 <span>33</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/sapling-treant?lv=19\">Lv 19 <span>31</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/sapling-treant?lv=20\">Lv 20 <span>85</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/sapling-treant?lv=21\">Lv 21 <span>84</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/sapling-treant?lv=23\">Lv 23 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/sapling-treant?lv=31\">Lv 31 <span>68</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/sapling-treant?lv=32\">Lv 32 <span>6</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/sapling-treant?lv=33\">Lv 33 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/sapling-treant?lv=42\">Lv 42 <span>3</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/sapling-treant?lv=50\">Lv 50 <span>29</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/sapling-treant?lv=51\">Lv 51 <span>4</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its le